{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/pulls/4810","id":3661506632,"node_id":"PR_kwDOLW-eZs7aPihI","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4810","diff_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4810.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4810.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4810","number":4810,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[select][combobox][number field] Ignore hidden-input changes while readonly or disabled","user":{"login":"lunaxislu","id":102783842,"node_id":"U_kgDOBiBbYg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102783842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunaxislu","html_url":"https://github.com/lunaxislu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunaxislu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunaxislu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunaxislu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunaxislu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunaxislu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunaxislu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunaxislu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunaxislu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunaxislu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #4809.\n\nFollow-up to #4806.\n\n`SelectRoot` and `AriaCombobox` use the same hidden-input autofill pattern that\n`OTPFieldRoot` used before #4806, but their hidden-input `onChange` handlers\nstill only guard `defaultPrevented`, not `disabled || readOnly`.\n\nThis PR applies the same locked-state guard to those remaining handlers.\n\n`AriaCombobox` is the shared root used by:\n- `Combobox.Root` (`selectionMode='single' | 'multiple'`)\n- `Autocomplete.Root` (`selectionMode='none'`)\n\n## What changed\n\n- `SelectRoot.tsx`: hidden-input `onChange` guard now matches OTP's\n- `AriaCombobox.tsx`: same one-line guard update\n- Regression tests added for:\n  - `Select`\n  - `Combobox` (`selectionMode='single'`)\n  - `Autocomplete` (`selectionMode='none'`)\n\nEach regression test fires `change` on the hidden input and verifies that no public state change happens while `readOnly` or `disabled`.\n\nNo public API change.","created_at":"2026-05-11T12:16:28Z","updated_at":"2026-05-18T05:31:20Z","closed_at":"2026-05-18T05:31:20Z","merged_at":"2026-05-18T05:31:20Z","merge_commit_sha":"254809a282d8c2aae9c9af64d6d48ec54d532e9f","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"colmtuite","id":805073,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwNTA3Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/805073?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/colmtuite","html_url":"https://github.com/colmtuite","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colmtuite/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colmtuite/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colmtuite/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colmtuite/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colmtuite/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colmtuite/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colmtuite/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colmtuite/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colmtuite/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"flaviendelangle","id":3309670,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMDk2NzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3309670?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/flaviendelangle","html_url":"https://github.com/flaviendelangle","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flaviendelangle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flaviendelangle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https: